# 🤖 Cursor AI Rules — Dev0 (v1.9)

Please adhere strictly to the architecture and engineering standards of the **Dev0** open-source repository:

1. **Master Architecture & Directives:** See [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md) and [`.qoder/rules/Agent.md`](.qoder/rules/Agent.md)
2. **Master Concept & System Vision:** See [`docs/MASTER_CONCEPT.md`](docs/MASTER_CONCEPT.md) / [`docs/MASTER_CONCEPT.de.md`](docs/MASTER_CONCEPT.de.md)
3. **System Overview & Tool Registry:** See [`docs/SYSTEM_OVERVIEW.md`](docs/SYSTEM_OVERVIEW.md)

- Always read target files completely before modifying them (`Read-Before-Write`).
- Enforce strict TypeScript typing (`npm run typecheck` -> `0` errors) and unit test verification (`npm test`).
